Package: batradar
Title: Compare Tracked Bat Migration with European Weather Radar Profiles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Edward", "Hurme", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "edwardhurme@gmail.com")
Description: Matches Sigfox-tracked migratory bats (move2 objects) to European
    weather radar vertical profile time series (VPTS, via 'getRad'), summarises
    radar migration per radar-night, extracts radar cells occupied by tagged
    bats in flight, and quantifies agreement between radar- and tag-based
    descriptions of migration: night-level detection, direction, flight
    height, phenology, and weather-response models fitted to both data sets.
